@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram of Digital Watch

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Adjusting Time" as AdjustingTime
state "Setting Alarm" as SettingAlarm
state "Alarm Triggered" as AlarmTriggered
state "Alarm Stopped" as AlarmStopped
state "Light On" as LightOn
state "Light Off" as LightOff

Idle : entry / Watch is turned on
Idle --> AdjustingTime : [Press Time Button]

AdjustingTime : entry / User is adjusting time
AdjustingTime --> Idle : [Release Time Button]
AdjustingTime --> SettingAlarm : [Press Alarm Button]

SettingAlarm : entry / User is setting alarm
SettingAlarm --> Idle : [Release Alarm Button]
SettingAlarm --> AlarmTriggered : [Set Alarm Time matches Current Time]

AlarmTriggered : entry / Alarm is triggered
AlarmTriggered --> AlarmStopped : [Press Stop Alarm Button]

AlarmStopped : entry / Alarm is stopped
AlarmStopped --> Idle : [Release Stop Alarm Button]

LightOn : entry / Light is turned on
LightOn --> LightOff : [Release Light Button]
LightOff : entry / Light is turned off
LightOff --> Idle : [No Action]

[*] --> Idle

Note: I've used the `@startuml` and `@enduml
@enduml
